<title>POLAND: POLISH VISCOPLAST UP 61 PCT ON BOURSE DEBUT.</title>
<headline>POLISH VISCOPLAST UP 61 PCT ON BOURSE DEBUT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish chemical firm Viscoplast SA started trade on the parallel floor of the Warsaw Stock Exchange at 22.5 zlotys, 60.7 percent above its public offering price of 14 zlotys.</p>
<p>Viscoplast's 900,000-share initial public offering in late January and early February was heavily oversubscribed.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
